<newsitem itemid="429944" id="root" date="1997-03-10" xml:lang="en">
<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Voltex raises interim shr, div.</title>
<headline>Voltex raises interim shr, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	10.33     vs    9.51</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		   3.00     vs    2.75</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    43.13     vs    41.09</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    58.55     vs    55.78</p>
<p>    Tax			  16.44     vs    15.01</p>
<p>    Finance costs	     7.22     vs    10.02</p>
<p>    Turnover		  772.23     vs    752.76</p>
<p>Div payable May 2</p>
<p>on register March 28</p>
<p>Full name: Voltex Holdings Ltd (electronics and electrical)</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said with the electrification and housing programmes gaining momentum, it was optimistic that the group would continue to show further growth in the second half of the financial year.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
